[B]Release 1.4.2 (ID 1040270)[/B]

[LIST]
[*][B]Option Validation for Format Classes[/B]: Option verifiers in [I]cv6\Core\Option\Check[/I] now validate custom format classes against allowed settings in the [I]cv6Core[/I] option group ([I]cv6CoreFaStyle[/I], [I]cv6CoreFaRotation[/I], [I]cv6CoreFaAnimation[/I]), returning clear error messages for disallowed classes.
[*][B]Filtered Autocomplete Suggestions[/B]: [I]cv6\Core\Helper\Icon::searchIcons()[/I] filters icon suggestions based on enabled styles in ACP settings. When the Brand option ([I]fab[/I]) is disabled, brand icons are excluded from suggestions.
[/LIST]
